0,Resounding Afro Asia: Interracial Music and the Politics of ...,https://books.google.com/books/about/Resounding_Afro_Asia.html?id=6uBaCwAAQBAJ,"Yet hybrid music is all too often marked -and marketed - under a single racial label. Resounding Afro Asia examines music projects that counter this convention; these projects instead foreground racial mixture in players, audiences, and sound in the very face of the ghettoizing culture industry.",Dera,Afro-Asiatic
1,"Dera, Kanakuru in Nigeria people group profile | Joshua Project",https://m.joshuaproject.net/people_groups/19366,"They call themselves ""Dera,"" while neighboring peoples often use the name ""Kanakuru."" Their language, Dera or Kanakuru, belongs to the West Chadic branch of the Afro-Asiatic language family and is related to several other Chadic languages spoken in northeastern Nigeria.",Dera,Afro-Asiatic
